  characters:
  - photo: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4e6e7c67c44482468764ec409456a45, type: 3}
    name: Frankie Lauterbur
    gender: Female
    description: "\tFrankie works as a warehouse caretaker for LX Corporation. Her
      coworkers describe her as a laid back woman who simply keeps her head down
      and cares about doing her job well. She works the night shift, allowing her
      to attend university during the day, where she is pursuing a degree in physics.\r\n\n\tFrankie
      was kicked out of her home when she turned eighteen and has lived in a friend's
      apartment ever since. Between rent, living expenses, and the modest salary
      she earns at the warehouse, she struggles to stay afloat while working toward
      a better future.\r"
  - photo: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 01b72c14496a4ad4380b1d16179bf8af, type: 3}
    name: clock
    gender: clock
    description: it clokc
